// 因此开关打开却尚未实现时也能一眼看出缺口在哪。
// Each feature registers only its assembly point here: the implementation arrives with the feature and goes into the
// matching branch, while the switches themselves come from the scaffold options, so an enabled-but-unimplemented
// feature leaves a visible gap instead of silently doing nothing.
